  "notes": [
    "Seed catalog built from public sources only.",
    "Contains Ford S-Max generation/engine mapping plus standard OBD-II PIDs that are good initial candidates for UI and live polling.",
    "Ford/FORScan extended PIDs for submodules (PCM/TCM/ABS/BCM/IPMA/PSCM/etc.) are not publicly standardized; they usually require capture/reverse-engineering from FORScan sessions on the exact vehicle.",
    "Designed to be hosted on Git and downloaded by a custom ESP32 web UI."
  ],
